DATA NOTICE: egs

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  data.tar.gz -> data/ (9 files: cross-section tables, PEGS4 data,
  voxel phantom, MTGP parameters, X-ray spectrum)

What:
  Input data for CUDA EGS photon transport.

Source:
  CUDA EGS 1.0.0, https://jonaslippuner.com/research/cuda-egs/
  (CUDA_EGS_1.0.0.zip, data/). All 9 files are byte-identical to the
  zip; CUDA_EGS_phantom.pegs4dat and CUDA_EGS_phantom_32.egsphant were
  renamed EGS_phantom.pegs4dat and EGS_phantom_32.egsphant (checked
  2026-11-19).

